# KuruPlay para Android

**La app de [KuruPlay](https://kuruplay.online) para el móvil.**
Anime y manga en español con tu cuenta, tu lista y tu progreso de la web.

[![Última versión](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Gymber1/kuruplay-app?label=versi%C3%B3n&color=e11d2e&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/Gymber1/kuruplay-app/releases/latest)
[![Descargas](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Gymber1/kuruplay-app/total?label=descargas&color=f8d88f&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/Gymber1/kuruplay-app/releases)
